### PolicyFlow REST API Request Collection
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create Policy Request (Intake - Benchmark 225.00 INR)
# Returns 201 Created on first call with status VALIDATED and premium "225.00"
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Sample Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 3. Safe Duplicate Replay (Idempotent Intake)
# Returns 200 OK with identical payload and Idempotent-Replayed: true header
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Sample Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 4. Idempotency Key Reuse With Different Payload (Conflict Detection)
# Returns 409 Conflict with IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED_WITH_DIFFERENT_PAYLOAD
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Modified Customer Name",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### 5. Validation Error Example (Unsuppored plan & end < start)
# Returns 422 Unprocessable Entity JSON with structured field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-INVALID-01",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Invalid Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1995-01-01",
  "destination": "SPACE",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-20",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-10",
  "plan_code": "ULTRA",
  "sum_insured": 999999
}

### 6. Submit Policy Issuance (SUCCESS Scenario)
# Replace {{requestId}} with the UUID from request #2
@requestId = your-uuid-here
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests/{{requestId}}/submit
Accept: application/json

### 7. Repeated Submit After ISSUED (Safe No-Op)
# Returns 200 OK with outcome ALREADY_ISSUED and provider_called: false
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests/{{requestId}}/submit
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Policy Detail (Includes Audit Trail and Attempts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests/{{requestId}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. List Policy Requests (Filtered by Status and Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests?status=ISSUED&per_page=15&page=1
Accept: application/json

### 10. Intake with TIMEOUT_AFTER_ISSUE Scenario
POST {{baseUrl}}/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-TIMEOUT-001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Timeout Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1990-01-15",
  "destination": "DOMESTIC",
  "trip_start": "2026-12-01",
  "trip_end": "2026-12-05",
  "plan_code": "BASIC",
  "sum_insured": 100000,
  "mock_scenario": "TIMEOUT_AFTER_ISSUE"
}

### 11. Inbound Provider Callback (Simulated External Event)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mock-insurer/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "event_id": "evt_sample_01",
  "event_type": "POLICY_ISSUED",
  "provider_reference": "PRV-MOCK-SAMPLE",
  "client_reference": "{{requestId}}",
  "policy_number": "POL-MOCK-SAMPLE",
  "occurred_at": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z"
}

### 12. Flush Due Mock Events (Dev-Only Outbox Trigger)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mock-insurer/events/flush
Accept: application/json
